}},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"On the ground in Manchester"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Supporting Manchester businesses"},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"We support"},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"MBKB Group"},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":", a Manchester training provider with more than 140 staff, from initial IT setup through to day-to-day support."},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"We run a team of"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Bold text 2","default":"field engineers who attend customer sites in person"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":", so Manchester is covered by engineers travelling to you rather than a call centre. When a site visit is requested, we aim to have an engineer with you the"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 3","default":"same working day"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"."},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 7","default":"Most issues are sorted remotely and quickly, with a first response the same working day. An engineer comes out when the job needs someone on site."}]}